{"schemaVersion":1,"id":-40013,"sections":[{"id":"script-20013","name":"原始脚本 20013","scripts":[20013],"start":0,"count":15}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20013:20013:1","scriptId":20013,"text":"这次传送的地方非常不妙……竟然直接落在了敌人面前，一堆粘土一样的生物围绕着两位外貌奇特的女性（？），一大一小。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20013:20013:2","scriptId":20013,"text":"正当还在考虑怎么应对的时候，那只坐在大型机甲上的女性先说话了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":62,"speaker":"德尔塔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20013:20013:3","scriptId":20013,"text":"“恩？你们是……埃普西隆信号消失的问题看来是你们弄的啊，钢舞姬们。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":62,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20013:20013:4","scriptId":20013,"text":"“呃……你好……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":62,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":62,"speaker":"德尔塔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20013:20013:5","scriptId":20013,"text":"“不用我们去找你们倒也不错，自己送上门来。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":62,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20013:20013:6","scriptId":20013,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":62,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":572,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20013:20013:7","scriptId":20013,"text":"“跟着长官走，真是让我开了眼界了，见识到了那么多的奇特的生物。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":572,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20013:20013:8","scriptId":20013,"text":"“别开玩笑了，这种事情还是少遇到点好……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":572,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20013:20013:9","scriptId":20013,"text":"突然，站在另一侧的女性开口了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":572,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20013:20013:10","scriptId":20013,"text":"“恩？你不是那个人类吗……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":56,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20013:20013:11","scriptId":20013,"text":"“那埃普西隆被干掉的情况也在情理之中。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":56,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":62,"speaker":"德尔塔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20013:20013:12","scriptId":20013,"text":"“哦？这些小家伙么有那么强吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":56,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20013:20013:13","scriptId":20013,"text":"“德尔塔，最好不要轻敌，特别是我们还在客场。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":56,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":62,"speaker":"德尔塔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20013:20013:14","scriptId":20013,"text":"“哼哼，兰布达你来地球那么久开始变得畏手畏脚了吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":56,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20013:20013:15","scriptId":20013,"text":"“随你怎么说。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":56,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
